><b>Answer options for post-eac-outcome </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Undetectable (50 copies/mL or less)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Suppressed but detectable (greater than 50 and 1000 copies/mL or less)</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Unsuppressed (greater than 1000 copies/mL)</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.post-eac-plan\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for post-eac-plan </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Remain on current regimen</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Regimen switched by the switch committee</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Refer to doctor for further management</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.eac-monitoring-status\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for eac-monitoring-status </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">EAC completed</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">EAC stopped</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Dead</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Lost to follow-up</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">Transferred out</li></ul></div>"
